						 <p>Upvoted at the opening line. Let's see if it keeps the upvote.</p> <blockquote> <p>Over a decade of work ended with all the fanfare of a Wikipedia edit.</p> </blockquote> <p>Another great line.</p> <p>Isabel's first dialogue is also great.</p> <p>Oh goddammit now I want to cry.</p> <p>Alright, yeah, this is amazing. I'd +1 again if I could. &quot;Isabel as psychopomp&quot; is just as good as I hoped it would be.</p> 
				 	]]>
