					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I have a lot of feelings about this. I've expressed them in chat.</p> <p>But the thing that you've touched on here (and I'm now considering writing about myself) is about the peopleness of things, and how over time the things we create take on, in many ways, the traits we imagine them having. The personification of the rover, in this case, isn't just in our heads.</p> <p>It's good. I've got no complaints. +1.</p> 
				 	]]>
